ECDSA.fail sweet spot research

This repository contains research and tooling based on public ECDSA.fail
measurements and source at https://github.com/Layr-Labs/ecdsafail-challenge.

The exploratory Q1050 patch changes a width constant in gnuchev's Q999
submission aee17ce0-0cbb-400f-bd42-0ebe29799799, source commit
f50ee007fdf84054fa44b71240c28a66a47aad8e. Its inherited implementation and
optimizations are credited to their upstream authors in that submission.

The challenge harness was adapted upstream from Google's elliptic-curve
resource-estimation code. This repository does not redistribute that harness.

Public benchmark metrics are attributed by submission ID, solver, source
commit, and API URL in the data and documentation. Local estimates are marked
unvalidated. No target achievement or hardware execution is claimed.
